# The bar going down under a page pushed is only drawn: the test chat opened from Home, the composer tapped where the
# bar still goes down over it takes the words, sent.
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
wait 800
tap 端到端测试
wait 200
shot 1-going
tapxy 200 -38
wait 300
type 栏下去时点的 {T}
until 栏下去时点的 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
wait 800
shot 2-sent
